Error: Jet.TraitNotImplemented: `T` isn't `Decode`
  --> Tests/UI/db_decode_unbound_param.jet:3:64
    |
  3 | load: fn<T>(row: [String:DBValue]) -[DB]> T [FieldError]! { db.decode<T>(row) }
    |                                                                ^^^^^^
 Why: Type parameter `T` doesn't declare the `Decode` bound, so a caller may choose a type without it
 Fix: Declare the bound where `T` is introduced: `<T: Decode>`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.TraitNotImplemented
